" Tridactyl settings. Loaded through the native messenger on startup.
" Home Manager appends the new-tab lines (see firefox/default.nix).
" Keys not mentioned here keep Tridactyl's defaults:
"   j/k scroll   d/u half page   gg/G top/bottom   f follow link (hints)
"   J/K tab left/right   o/t open here/new tab   x close tab   u undo close
"   / search   H/L back/forward   yy copy URL   p/P open clipboard URL
"   b tab list   :  command line

colourscheme dark
set smoothscroll true
set modeindicator true
